# The bar going down under a page pushed is only drawn: the test chat opened from Home, the composer tapped where the
# bar still goes down over it takes the words, sent.
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap 端到端测试
# (200 ms into the bar's going down: the composer tapped where the bar is only drawn)
wait 200
now shot 1-going
now tapxy 200 -38
type 栏下去时点的 {T}
field 栏下去时点的 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 栏下去时点的 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 2-sent
